The upstream agent_reach package, platform guides, scripts, and tests are included.
ReachKit 0.2 modifies agent_reach/cli.py (Xiaohongshu login verification)
and agent_reach/transcribe.py (explicit cookie settings and child-process configuration).
agent_reach/channels/xiaohongshu.py preserves signed source links and top-level
note identifiers/tokens during result cleaning.
ReachKit 0.2.1 adds a structured browser-cookie state in agent_reach/channels/boss.py
and makes four tests in test_channels.py/test_reddit_channel.py skip explicitly
when their environment cannot create real symbolic links.
tests/conftest.py checks Windows token privileges and Developer Mode before
running symbolic-link tests, preserving those tests on supported environments.
The Xiaoyuzhou script verifies Python executables and accepts REACHKIT_PYTHON;
its shell-test environment explicitly uses the test interpreter.
ReachKit adds the reachkit package, integrated skill and references, tests_reachkit,
launchers, maintenance documentation, and project packaging changes.
ReachKit 0.2.2 narrows the compatibility skills' triggers and environment guidance,
removes installation promotions, and routes update instructions to local ReachKit
releases. Video references distinguish metadata, subtitles and transcription.
Documentation tests target the documentation shipped with ReachKit.
Upstream promotional assets, translations and internal design notes are omitted;
the original project remains available at the upstream URL above.

